      <para unique="1046104"/>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046106">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046108">Permute 128-bit floating-point fields in ymm2 and ymm3/mem using controls from imm8 and store result in ymm1.</para>
